               Ellery                                                       Tamsin Rook             
                                                                                                    
┌── Tamsin Rook ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                                                  │
│   Red Harl's in the toll-fort, Your Former Grace! Took it in the night. I rode up to the gate    │
│   like a fool and he leaned over the wall and asked if I wanted my old job back.                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
